{"id": "ralu-sd3-two-stage", "name": "RALU-aligned SD3 two stage", "family": "sampler", "subfamily": "multi-resolution", "plain": "A simpler low-res then high-res SD3 pass that reuses the Flux Z value. It upsamples everything by nearest neighbour, injects block-correlated noise at the matching level, and continues with plain Euler. It can split across two nodes because the seed travels with the latent.", "math": "e\u2081=.35, Z=6.317, N=[10,20], shifts [5.8741,3.1334] by default.\ns\u2081=e\u2081/(Z(1\u2212e\u2081)+e\u2081); \u03b2=1/(Z(1\u2212e\u2081)+e\u2081); \u03b1=Z(1\u2212e\u2081)/(Z(1\u2212e\u2081)+e\u2081).\nx_hi=\u03b2\u00b7up\u2082(x_lo)+\u03b1\u00b7n, n from 2\u00d72 blocks with \u03a3=I+\u03b311\u1d40, \u03b3=\u22121/Z\u00b2+1e-6.\nThen x\u2190x+v \u0394\u03c3 with optional CFG.", "props": {"order": 1, "stages": 1, "stochastic": "other", "multistep": false, "prediction_space": "flow", "steps_hint": {"value": "N=[10,20]", "label": "from code"}}, "evidence": [{"where": "Milkyawaway__comfyui-ralu-sampling/ralu_engine.py:232", "symbol": "compute_ralu_2stage_params"}, {"where": "Milkyawaway__comfyui-ralu-sampling/ralu_engine.py:274", "symbol": "sample_cholesky_spatial_noise"}, {"where": "Milkyawaway__comfyui-ralu-sampling/sd3_two_stage_runtime.py:204", "symbol": "run_sd3_highres_denoise"}], "providers": [{"pack": "comfyui-ralu-sampling.disabled", "author": "Milkyawaway", "licence": "none-found", "kind": "original", "nodes": ["SD3LowResDenoise", "SD3HighResDenoise", "SD3TwoStageDenoise"], "note": "", "verdict": "", "risks": [], "res4lyf": false}], "providers_n": 1, "in_core": false, "live": false, "needs_pack": true, "core_ref": {}, "family_fit": [], "claims": [], "label": "from code", "surprise": "", "rendered": false, "rendered_ids": [], "risks": [], "flagged_providers": 0, "licences": ["none-found"], "verdicts": [], "audit": null, "run_patch": "", "run_guider": "", "prefer_model": ""}